"id":"S11215","name":{"zh":"威震华夏","en":"Might Resounds Across China"},"year":"219","month":"7"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1019","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"2900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10702","name":{"zh":"夷陵之战","en":"Battle of Yiling"},"year":"221","month":"5"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"99","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":3,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,14,64,85,86,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国大臣，太尉，行为艺术家，典故卧冰求鲤的主人公，为人以忠孝闻名，常常被他人称为孝圣。出身琅琊王氏，曹髦被弑杀时，王祥大声号哭说：这是老臣的罪过啊！涕泗横流，众人都感到惭愧。不久，迁任司空。于邓艾与钟会奉命伐蜀之前，得知了二人无法平安归来的占卜结果。司马昭犹豫让谁继位之时，提醒其应让长子司马炎继位。在武帝朝备受礼遇，泰始四年，王祥去世，享年八十九岁。","tc":"魏國大臣，太尉，行為藝術家，典故臥冰求鯉的主人公，為人以忠孝聞名，常常被他人稱為孝圣。出身瑯琊王氏，曹髦被弒殺時，王祥大聲號哭說：這是老臣的罪過啊！涕泗橫流，眾人都感到慚愧。不久，遷任司空。于鄧艾與鐘會奉命伐蜀之前，得知了二人無法平安歸來的占卜結果。司馬昭猶豫讓誰繼位之時，提醒其應讓長子司馬炎繼位。在武帝朝備受禮遇，泰始四年，王祥去世，享年八十九歲。","en":"A minister of Wei, Chief Officer, a ‘performance artist’, and the protagonist of the story ‘Lying on Ice for Carp’. Renowned for his loyalty and filial piety, he was often hailed as the ‘Sage of Filial Piety’. Hailing from the Wang clan of Langya, when Cao Mao was assassinated, Wang Xiang wept aloud, crying, ‘This is the fault of this old servant!’ Weeping so profusely that tears and snivel flowed, all present were shamed. Soon after, he was transferred to Chief Minister. Before Deng Ai and Zhong Hui were ordered to attack Shu, he learned of a divination that neither would return safely. When Sima Zhao hesitated over who should succeed him, Wang Xiang reminded him that his eldest son Sima Yan should inherit the position. He was treated with great honor during Emperor Wu's reign, and in the fourth year of Taishi, Wang Xiang passed away at the age of eighty-nine.","jp":"魏の大臣、太尉。「行動芸術家」であり、故事「臥氷求鯉」の主人公。忠孝の人として名高く、人々からしばしば「孝聖」と称された。瑯琊王氏の出身。曹髦が弑逆された際、王祥は大声を上げて「これは老臣の罪である！」と号泣し、涙と鼻水を流して嘆いたため、人々は皆恥じ入った。やがて司空に転任。鄧艾と鍾会が命を受けて蜀討伐に向かう前、二人が無事に帰還できないという占いの結果を知っていた。司馬昭が後継者選びに迷った際には、長子の司馬炎を立てるべきだと進言した。武帝の朝廷でも手厚い礼遇を受け、泰始4年に死去した。享年89。","kr":"위나라의 대신이자 태위. 행위 예술가이자 고사 '와빙구리'의 주인공이다. 사람됨이 충효로 이름 높아 흔히 '효성(孝聖)'이라 불렸다. 낭야 왕씨 출신으로, 조모가 시해되었을 때 왕상이 대성통곡하며 '이는 노신의 죄입니다!'라고 외치며 눈물과 콧물을 흘리니 모두가 부끄러워하였다. 얼마 지나지 않아 사공으로 승진했다. 등애와 종회가 명을 받아 촉을 정벌하러 떠나기 전, 두 사람이 무사히 돌아오지 못할 것이라는 점괘 결과를 미리 알았다. 사마소가 후계를 누구로 삼을지 망설일 때 장남 사마염에게 대를 잇게 해야 한다고 진언했다. 무제 시기에도 극진한 예우를 받았으며, 태시 4년에 향년 89세로 세상을 떠났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10405","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"祥","nameTc":"祥","nameEn":"Xiang","nameJp":"祥","nameKr":"상","nameOther":"","word":"休徵","wordTc":"休徵","wordEn":"Xiuzheng","wordJp":"休徴","wordKr":"휴징","wordOther":"","icon":"王祥","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"203","city":"CS1018","gender":"0","rule":"27","force":"14","wise":"64","politics":"85","charm":"86","will":"89","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"5/5/5/5/5/68/44/5","battleAttribute":"1